ebooks component keeps working unchanged).\n- Launching a pipeline tutorial results in the pipeline being available in\n  the user's project via existing Data Science Pipelines behavior (validates\n  the Data Science Pipelines component keeps working unchanged).\n- A tutorial packaged per the format can be launched end-to-end in a test\n  project without manual configuration steps beyond authentication.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P0): the Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user can\n  launch a tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the\n  notebook, or importing the pipeline).\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37852,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a4d770febd292af1","agent_id":"a815ab71ef3d0efaa","session_id":"a958864d-502f-4687-961c-c18572f3c4be","uuid":"bed6cecb-8883-49b9-9066-ce6634ac5eb2","timestamp":"2026-10-22T04:00:28.106Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9019"}
