{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a78a6dbee1464960","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tstrat_id: RHAISTRAT-9019\n3\tscore: 14\n4\tpass: true\n5\trecommendation: accept\n6\tissues:\n7\t- severity: minor\n8\t  criterion: Completeness\n9\t  description: No epic explicitly names how packaged tutorials and their metadata\n10\t    are distributed/hosted so the running Dashboard gallery can read the catalog;\n11\t    implied by E002 scope (rendered from tutorial packaging metadata) - make the catalog\n12\t    source explicit in E002 scope\n13\terror: null\n14\t---\n15\t## Review Summary\n16\t\n17\tScore: 14/14 — pass\n18\tRecommendation: accept\n19\t\n20\tContract validator: OK (all contract checks passed: epic body sections, canonical\n21\tcomponent names, Rule 11 docs-last coverage, priority inheritance).\n22\t\n23\tTriage consistency: `triage: null` (full decomposition) with 4 epics — multi-epic\n24\toutput is expected; no triage contradiction.\n25\t\n26\tInputs reviewed: strategy RHAISTRAT-9019, decomposition summary, epic files\n27\tE001–E004, ai-signals rationale files for all four epics. No conditional branch\n28\tfiles exist (none were created). Architecture context verified: Dashboard,\n29\tNotebooks, and Data Science Pipelines all exist in\n30\t`.context/architecture-context/architecture/rhoai-3.0/` and are Konflux onboarded,\n31\tconfirming the summary's \"no onboarding chain\" claim; owning teams (RHOAI\n32\tDashboard, Workbenches) match the architecture context files.\n33\t\n34\t## Criterion Details\n35\t\n36\t### 1. HLR Coverage (2/2)\n37\tAll four HLRs are mapped and the traceability matrix is present in the summary:\n38\tHLR-1 (P0) → E002, HLR-2 (P0) → E003, HLR-3 (P1) → E001, HLR-4 (P2) → E004.\n39\tEvery epic's HLR Traceability section matches the matrix. The P2 HLR is covered\n40\t(not deferred) by E004. Priority inheritance is correct: E001 maps to a P1 HLR\n41\tbut blocks both P0 epics (E002, E003)