dated as acceptance criteria below.\n51\t\n52\t## Acceptance Criteria\n53\t\n54\t- Given a user with a project and an available tutorial, when the user\n55\t  launches the tutorial from the gallery, then it opens in their project — a\n56\t  workbench with the notebook loaded for notebook tutorials, or the pipeline\n57\t  imported for pipeline tutorials.\n58\t- The gallery renders tutorials from the tutorial packaging format's\n59\t  metadata, and launches honor the pinned images each tutorial declares.\n60\t- Launching a notebook tutorial creates a workbench via the existing\n61\t  workbench lifecycle with the notebook available in it (validates the\n62\t  Notebooks component keeps working unchanged).\n63\t- Launching a pipeline tutorial results in the pipeline being available in\n64\t  the user's project via existing Data Science Pipelines behavior (validates\n65\t  the Data Science Pipelines component keeps working unchanged).\n66\t- A tutorial packaged per the format can be launched end-to-end in a test\n67\t  project without manual configuration steps beyond authentication.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- HLR-1 (P0): the Dashboard has a tutorial gallery from which a user can\n72\t  launch a tutorial into their project (opening a workbench with the\n73\t  notebook, or importing the pipeline).\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-82f1ac037f8c7c0e","agent_id":"aecfdea50d8f79eb3","session_id":"a958864d-502f-4687-961c-c18572f3c4be","uuid":"ffa7f9ef-e41b-4ddd-9b25-fe1ecf132b12","timestamp":"2026-10-22T04:06:19.766Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a092a1a8025d5aa0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9019 decomposition"}
